X-SOURCE:Morehead Planetarium & Science Center
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T150000
DTSTAMP:20261107T005536
CREATED:20261009T152307Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261103T173711Z
UID:40693-1794049200-1794063600@moreheadplanetarium.org
SUMMARY:Saturday Science Sparks: UNC's Magic of Science
DESCRIPTION:Be a Scientist with UNC’s Magic of Science!\n\n\n\nRoll up your sleeves and experience how stuff works with UNC-Chapel Hill’s Magic of Science. STEM students will engage Morehead visitors with a variety of hands-on activities. Their goals? Spark curiosity and build confidence in young learners\, so they see themselves in science. \n\n\n\n“When a scientist is made\, the world becomes a better place.” – UNC’s Magic of Science \n\n\n\nLocated in the Launch Lab. Included with paid admission. \n\n\n\n\n\nMORE is happening at Morehead this year\n\n\n\nNew for 2026\, Saturday Science Sparks offers Morehead guests a closer encounter with current science. Covering topics like astronomy\, the physics of juggling\, and computer science\, this program collaborates with community partners and academic clubs\, bringing you up-close experiences in the exciting world of STEAM. Saturday Science Sparks is open to the public and included in admission.
URL:https://moreheadplanetarium.org/calendar/saturday-science-sparks-magic-of-science/
LOCATION:Morehead Planetarium and Science Center\, 250 E Franklin St\, Chapel Hill\, North Carolina\, 27516\, United States
CATEGORIES:Special Programs
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://moreheadplanetarium.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/2025-11.21-SnapPeaDinner-12-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
